# 00 章第 11.6 节：类型检查、ESLint、Stylelint、knip、jscpd、单元测试、接口测试全部在这里跑，只在这里跑
name: ci

on:
  push:
    branches: [main]
  pull_request:

jobs:
  check:
    runs-on: ubuntu-24.04
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v5
      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4
      - uses: actions/setup-node@v5
        with:
          node-version-file: .nvmrc
          cache: pnpm
      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
      # 接口测试用 Testcontainers，GitHub 的 ubuntu 机器自带 Docker
      - run: pnpm run check
